{
    "prompt": "\"Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. Find an object. Approach it, check and take it. Move to location and perform task. If failed, scan area. list of available nodes: <Action ID = IsObjectVisible    /> <Action ID = IsObjectApproached    /> <Action ID = GrabObject    /> <Action ID = MoveToLocation    /> <Action ID = ScanAreaForObject    /> <SubTree ID = CheckObjectProperties    /> <SubTree ID = PerformTask    />\"",
